{"suttaId":"tha-ap237","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8035,8047],"vripara":"19"},"segments":{"tha-ap237:0.3":"Vedikārakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap237:1.1":"“Vipassino bhagavato, bodhiyā pādaputtame;","tha-ap237:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, kāresiṃ vedikaṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap237:2.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, kāresiṃ vedikaṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap237:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, vedikāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap237:3.1":"“Ito ekādase kappe, ahosiṃ sūriyassamo;","tha-ap237:3.3":"Sattarattanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap237:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap237:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā vedikārako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap237:6.1":"Vedikārakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
